# Metadata for RDF/XML test files

These are RDF data files serialized in the classic RDF/XML syntax. They are
collected from external sources: three are W3C RDF/XML test-suite syntax tests
and one is the complete FOAF vocabulary definition. They exercise the
graphinout RDF reader against real-world RDF/XML constructs.

ddot.it/this ..kind.. collected
ddot.it/this ..format.. format:rdf-xml
ddot.it/this ..content.. RDF/XML test data: W3C RDF/XML syntax test cases plus the FOAF vocabulary definition.


# --- File: foaf-ontology.rdf ---

foaf-ontology.rdf ..kind.. collected
foaf-ontology.rdf ..format.. format:rdf-xml
foaf-ontology.rdf ..content.. The complete FOAF (Friend of a Friend) vocabulary definition expressed in RDF/XML using RDFS and OWL. Declares owl:Ontology, owl:Class, owl:ObjectProperty, owl:DatatypeProperty, rdfs:subClassOf / rdfs:subPropertyOf, rdfs:domain / rdfs:range, vs:term_status and dc metadata. Mixes namespaces rdf, rdfs, owl, vs (sw-vocab-status), foaf, wot and dc.
foaf-ontology.rdf ..tests.. RDF/XML parsing of a large real-world ontology: many namespace prefixes, OWL/RDFS class & property axioms, rdf:about / rdf:resource references, and embedded XML comments.
foaf-ontology.rdf ..depicts.. FOAF vocabulary terms (Person, Agent, Document, knows, mbox, ...).
foaf-ontology.rdf ..source url.. http://xmlns.com/foaf/spec/
foaf-ontology.rdf ..license.. Creative Commons Attribution 1.0 (CC BY 1.0)


# --- File: w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ---

w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..kind.. collected
w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..format.. format:rdf-xml
w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..content.. W3C RDF/XML syntax test case showing how an XML predefined entity (the ampersand) is represented inside an rdf:about attribute value. Single rdf:Description with rdf:about="http://example/q?abc=1&#38;def=2" carrying an rdf:value of "xxx". The ampersand is encoded as the numeric character reference &#38;. Author: Dan Connolly.
w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..tests.. Correct handling of XML predefined-entity / numeric character reference (&#38; ampersand) inside an rdf:about URI value.
w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-amp-in-url-test001.rdf ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License


# --- File: w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ---

w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..kind.. collected
w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..format.. format:rdf-xml
w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..content.. W3C RDF/XML syntax test case for datatyped literals. A single rdf:Description about http://example.org/foo with two properties using rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer" (value 10); the second property additionally carries xml:lang="fr" (a datatype + language production).
w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..tests.. RDF/XML typed-literal handling via rdf:datatype, and the interaction of rdf:datatype with xml:lang.
w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-datatypes-test001.rdf ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License


# --- File: w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ---

w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..kind.. collected
w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..format.. format:rdf-xml
w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..content.. W3C RDF/XML syntax test case for xml:lang scoping. A single rdf:Description about http://example.org/node with one property using rdf:parseType="Literal" whose content is "chat", demonstrating that an in-scope xml:lang applies to rdf:parseType="Literal" element content. Author: Dave Beckett.
w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..tests.. In-scope xml:lang applied to rdf:parseType="Literal" (XML literal) element content values.
w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-xmllang-test001.rdf ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
